<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Architecture Diagram | Judd Cyber Consulting Group</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-dark: #0f172a;
            --secondary-dark: #1e293b;
            --accent-blue: #2563eb;
            --accent-cyan: #0284c7;
            --text-light: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --text-dark: #334155;
            --bg-light: #f8fafc;
            --card-border: #e2e8f0;
            --node-bg: #ffffff;
            --highlight-glow: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 1.25rem 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, var(--secondary-dark) 100%);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 5rem 8% 6rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.75rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .diagram-section {
            padding: 4rem 8%;
            margin-top: -3rem;
        }

        .diagram-container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
        }

        .diagram-title-bar {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--card-border);
        }

        .diagram-title-bar h2 {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .diagram-title-bar p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* 3-Column Diagram Grid */
        .pillars-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .pillar-card {
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 1.75rem;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .pillar-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px var(--highlight-glow);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .pillar-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--card-border);
        }

        .pillar-badge {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-right: 1rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .pillar-title {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Internal Component Nodes */
        .nodes-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .node-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .node-card:hover {
            border-left-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }

        .node-card h4 {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .node-card h4 .status-dot {
            height: 8px;
            width: 8px;
            background-color: #10b981;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .node-card p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* Flow Indicators */
        .flow-connector {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .flow-connector span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin: 0 0.5rem;
        }

        footer {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2.5rem 8%;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-dark);
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">JUDD CYBER <span>CONSULTING GROUP</span></div>
        <nav>
            <a href="index.html">Home</a>
            <a href="#" class="active">Architecture</a>
            <a href="#audit">IT Audit</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>IT General Controls <span>Architecture Framework</span></h1>
        <p>Visualizing enterprise risk assurance, identity governance, system controls, and automated compliance auditing workflows.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="diagram-section">
        <div class="diagram-container">
            <div class="diagram-title-bar">
                <h2>Enterprise Risk & ITGC Operational Model</h2>
                <p>Standardized 3-Pillar Framework for Technology Risk Assurance & System Integrity</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pillars-grid">
                <!-- Pillar 1: IAM -->
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-header">
                        <div class="pillar-badge">01</div>
                        <div class="pillar-title">Identity & Access Management (IAM)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="nodes-container">
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Role-Based Access Control <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Enforcing least privilege principles across active directory and SaaS environments.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Segregation of Duties (SoD) <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Automated policy checks preventing conflicting operational permissions.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Privileged Access Mgmt <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>MFA enforcement, credential vaulting, and session logging for admin users.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pillar 2: ITGC -->
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-header">
                        <div class="pillar-badge">02</div>
                        <div class="pillar-title">Infrastructure & System Security</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="nodes-container">
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Change Management <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Formalized code reviews, staging environment testing, and deployment sign-offs.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Database Security <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>3NF relational integrity, encrypted backups, and parameterized SQL handling.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Network Perimeter Controls <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Next-gen firewall rule enforcement, DMZ isolation, and intrusion detection.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pillar 3: Audit & Monitoring -->
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-header">
                        <div class="pillar-badge">03</div>
                        <div class="pillar-title">Audit, Compliance & Monitoring</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="nodes-container">
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>SIEM & Log Aggregation <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Real-time log analysis and automated anomaly detection (Splunk / Wireshark).</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Automated ITGC Auditing <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Continuous evidence gathering for Sarbanes-Oxley (SOX) and SOC 2 reporting.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="node-card">
                            <h4>Incident Response <span class="status-dot"></span></h4>
                            <p>Pre-defined containment playbooks, forensic logging, and threat mitigation.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Inter-Pillar Data Flow Banner -->
            <div class="flow-connector">
                Continuous Telemetry <span>&rarr;</span> Automated Control Validation <span>&rarr;</span> Audit Evidence Repository
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Judd Cyber Consulting Group. CIS Portfolio Front-End Artifact.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
